ad4-897b-5475-96e7-f211a321e037" :question/math-academy-id "q-126484" :question/problem "Consider the matrix\n\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 5\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "Let's analyze each statement in turn.\n\n- $B$ is upper triangular: **False.** This fails because $B$ has non-zero entries below the main diagonal:\n\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 5\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- $B$ is lower triangular: **True.** All the entries above the main diagonal of $B$ are zeros:\n\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 5\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- ${B}^{T}$ is lower triangular: **False.** It has non-zero entries above the main diagonal:\n\n$$\n{B}^{T}=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 5\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nThe true statements are:\n\n- $B$ is lower triangular."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186269146 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "625bfb45-fbfc-5c45-8a45-c019c11a0ebf" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437914} {:answer/id #uuid "24d952bc-2191-54a7-991a-b406bdb29aee" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437915}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "24d952bc-2191-54a7-991a-b406bdb29aee" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437915} :answer-field/id #uuid "045121f2-bd39-5c05-8c52-53047cd108bc" :answer-field/key "$A$ is upper triangular." :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438986} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f7c070b1-6d63-5f49-bfdb-cbd527525bb1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437916} {:answer/id #uuid "f81712fc-ad06-5cc5-b788-916434b10d7f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answe