e the result of $A+{A}^{T}$ has all the entries above the main diagonal equal to zero: \n\n$$\n{A}^{T}+A=\\begin{bmatrix}16 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 6\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nThe true statements are:\n\n- $A$ is upper triangular.\n- $A$ is lower triangular.\n- ${A}^{T}+A$ is lower triangular."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186326929 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "99c6bb28-f335-5bbd-98ef-7c10debcd116" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438308} {:answer/id #uuid "f443bd43-943d-5991-a1db-7e129b593206" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438309}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f443bd43-943d-5991-a1db-7e129b593206" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438309} :answer-field/id #uuid "cbe78ff6-d1f1-58f5-8add-6b463affc7cc" :answer-field/key "$A$ is lower triangular." :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439183} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e07dc0e6-51e2-5ce8-a1b4-44727450bef9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438310} {:answer/id #uuid "cef77811-df7c-59ed-a36f-ed5228a3ebc8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438311}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e07dc0e6-51e2-5ce8-a1b4-44727450bef9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438310} :answer-field/id #uuid "371815f8-f16e-5680-9ce5-31f3cff1d9be" :answer-field/key "${A}^{T}-A$ is lower triangular." :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439184} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "76c420bb-1528-5dc2-9b89-925a5134c93a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438312} {:answer/id #uuid "f06b9547-425a-5254-b4f6