}1 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "Let's analyze each statement in turn.\n\n- $D$ is upper triangular: **False.** This fails because $D$ has non-zero entries below the main diagonal:\n\n$$\nD=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- $D$ is lower triangular: **True.** All the entries above the main diagonal of $D$ are zeros:\n\n$$\nD=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- ${D}^{T}$ is upper triangular: **True.** All the entries below the main diagonal of ${D}^{T}$ are zeros:\n\n$$\n{D}^{T}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nThe true statements are:\n\n- $D$ is lower triangular.\n- ${D}^{T}$ is upper triangular."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186571420 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0f5e3104-7cbb-553b-a0d4-b02d61cb8874" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186576327} {:answer/id #uuid "30050467-b3b0-540a-aefb-ac26951b0a68" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186576336}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0f5e3104-7cbb-553b-a0d4-b02d61cb8874" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186576327} :answer-field/id #uuid "1377adec-7f6e-5304-8b00-f728efc3c5b7" :answer-field/key "$B$ is lower triangular." :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186576328} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2b6b8b0d-7ff0-59a0-9419-9bcc6dde0346" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186576335} {:answer/id #uuid "b32eb6e4-ad48-52e9-8cec-78071c9a9b97" :answer/type {