$ is upper triangular: **True.** This holds because the result of ${B}^{T}+B$ has all the entries below the main diagonal equal to zero:\n\n$$\n{B}^{T}+B=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -8\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nThe true statements are:\n\n- ${B}^{T}+B$ is upper triangular."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186673565 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "75c42747-8e15-5929-b70b-a18beb87fd31" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186673586} {:answer/id #uuid "db0cdd27-baf5-5e0b-882f-e26a71d9ce68" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186673615}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "75c42747-8e15-5929-b70b-a18beb87fd31" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186673586} :answer-field/id #uuid "5e33ead6-618f-5b8c-bc31-62182e2a36f7" :answer-field/key "$A$ is upper triangular." :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186673579} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5f6c45fa-e48d-5450-a870-119add8402a2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186673580} {:answer/id #uuid "779af540-b6e9-5ba7-8bc1-2e826b7cb02f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186673587}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5f6c45fa-e48d-5450-a870-119add8402a2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186673580} :answer-field/id #uuid "b419f974-e928-588a-9df9-36c2397cbc32" :answer-field/key "$A$ is lower triangular." :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186673604} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "002f6848-f17b-5841-a663-5ee03a880263" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186673562} {:answer/id #uuid "43d9ee8b-5093-57b9-b52c-ee9fef610465" :